WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.419 --> 00:00:02.700
Greetings, everybody.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.059
My name is Sam Deiter, and I'm a senior Unreal Engine

3
00:00:05.059 --> 00:00:07.160
instructor with Epic Games.

4
00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:10.179
In the following introductionary video tutorial series,

5
00:00:10.179 --> 00:00:12.939
we're going to be taking a look at Groom, which

6
00:00:12.939 --> 00:00:16.780
is Unreal Engine 5's solution for rendering hair

7
00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:18.570
and fur.

8
00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:21.170
We're going to first start this tutorial series

9
00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:23.850
by taking a look at what Groom is so we can get

10
00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:26.969
more familiar with what we can do with Groom when

11
00:00:26.969 --> 00:00:28.929
it comes to Unreal Engine 5.

12
00:00:28.929 --> 00:00:30.929
We're then going to take a look at how we enable

13
00:00:30.929 --> 00:00:33.130
the various Groom plugins.

14
00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.850
Then we'll take a look at importing Groom assets.

15
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:38.250
We'll explore the Groom tool settings,

16
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.969
as there are quite a few tools within the Groom editor

17
00:00:40.969 --> 00:00:43.250
that you can use to help performance in the look

18
00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.409
and feel of your Groom assets.

19
00:00:45.409 --> 00:00:48.929
We'll also take a look at creating Groom materials that

20
00:00:48.929 --> 00:00:50.570
are set up specifically so that they

21
00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:53.289
can interact with the hair and allow you more control

22
00:00:53.289 --> 00:00:57.460
over how the hair looks and reacts when

23
00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:00.250
it's placed on your assets.

24
00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.729
We'll then a look at applying Groom to assets

25
00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:07.890
and follow up that with Groom shadow and lighting.

26
00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:09.409
So we've got a lot to cover.

27
00:01:09.409 --> 00:01:10.930
Let's go ahead and get started

28
00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:13.409
with our Groom overview.
